i-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Midnight picnic.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Midnight_picnic..png/revision/latest?cb=20250522220856\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Midnight picnic.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Midnight_picnic..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250522220856\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Midnight_picnic..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250522220856 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Midnight_picnic..png/revision/latest?cb=20250522220856 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Midnight picnic.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Midnight_picnic..png\" data-image-name=\"Midnight picnic..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.\" title=\"My presumably scrotum.\">My presumably scrotum.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters.\" title=\"Maybe we&#39;re the monsters.\">Maybe we're the monsters.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Midnight picnic.</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 22 May 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Midnight_picnic.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> sarcastically says \"I’m so sorry to interrupt the children’s midnight picnic\", when <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> decide to sit on the stage floor to confer over their guesses to the <a href=\"/wiki/Convince_the_other_team_that_the_following_things_are_the_opposite_of_what_they_are\" title=\"Convince the other team that the following things are the opposite of what they are\">Convince the other team that the following things are the opposite of what they are</a> task. The light bulb and one of the small faces for the <a href=\"/wiki/Tell_Alex_why_the_light_bulb_turns_on\" title=\"Tell Alex why the light bulb turns on\">Tell Alex why the light bulb turns on</a> task appear in the episode's title card.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Midnight_picnic.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> expertly presides over another episode of profoundly important tasks, but he may come to regret a bold promise involving his mighty trousers. Greg's adoring assistant Little <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> has some trouser issues of his own, thanks to <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a>, but he gamely records events as <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> repeatedly punches a mannequin in the groin and <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> pops raisins into a little hole in a wooden box. Meanwhile, <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> strikes a memorable pose and <a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</a> demonstrates her acting chops.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/19/4/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jason Mantzoukas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mathew Baynton</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Stevie Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_that_least_suits_its_name_if_you_shout_it_loudly_while_we%27re_all_looking_at_it_on_the_screen\" title=\"The thing that least suits its name if you shout it loudly while we&#39;re all looking at it on the screen\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing that least suits its name if you shout it loudly while we're all looking at it on the screen.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_wetsuits_on_mannequins\" title=\"Put the most wetsuits on mannequins\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put the most wetsuits on mannequins. The mannequins must be wearing their wetsuits properly. Also, you must tiptoe throughout and put your finger on your lips and say \"shhh\" at least once every 20 seconds.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Convince_the_other_team_that_the_following_things_are_the_opposite_of_what_they_are\" title=\"Convince the other team that the following things are the opposite of what they are\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Convince the other team that the following things are the opposite of what they are.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tell_Alex_why_the_light_bulb_turns_on\" title=\"Tell Alex why the light bulb turns on\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Tell Alex why the light bulb turns on. You may not touch or tamper with the light bulb.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Read_this_out_loud_and_in_full\" title=\"Read this out loud and in full\">S</a>\n</td>\n<td>Read this out loud and in full. If you fail to read this out loud and in full, you will fail the current task.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Win_a_game_of_Front_Ham\" title=\"Win a game of Front Ham\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Win a game of Front Ham. One at a time, each person must discard three socks from the washing line and add one. If all your coloured socks are removed, you are eliminated.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">21\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Midnight_picnic.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>During the live filming for this episode, an audience member had brought in their nine year old child, and <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> ridiculed the parent for bringing the child to the filming.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>This is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> not won by <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Midnight_picnic.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label